# Generated. Placeholder sources come from `npm run seed:media`; derivatives from
# `npm run build:media`. Real documentation replaces public/media/ in Phase 0 and
# SHOULD then be tracked (or held in object storage and synced) — at which point
# remove the first line below and keep ignoring only derived/.
# public/media/ IS TRACKED: it holds the artist's actual documentation, which is the
# content of the archive and must be versioned with it. Only the generated derivatives
# and social cards are ignored — those are reproducible from the originals by
# `npm run build:media` and `npm run build:social`.
public/media/derived/
public/media/social/
# public/.assetsignore is tracked ON PURPOSE — it keeps public/ present in a fresh
# clone. Without a tracked file in it, git omits the directory entirely and Wrangler's
# Astro setup fails on a missing path. Do not add `public/` here.

